OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly rain clears to the east
OL,6,Fto leave another day of sunny spells
OL,7,Fand blustery showers, the showers most
OL,8,Ffrequent in the northwest. A rather
OL,9,Fwindy day for all, feeling cool in the
OL,10,Fwind.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers easing overnight, but
OL,13,Fsome persisting near the coast. Mainly
OL,14,Fdry elsewhere, but breezy, keeping
OL,15,Ftemperatures rather mild for the time
OL,16,Fof year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
