OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FDry at first, but increasingly
OL,6,Fcloudy as rain moves in from the west
OL,7,Fduring the morning. Turning heavy for
OL,8,Fa time, especially over western hills.
OL,9,FRather windy.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FPatchy
OL,12,Frain on Saturday, then drier on Sunday
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells but blustery
OL,14,Fwesterly winds. Brighter with lighter
OL,15,Fwinds on Monday and a little warmer
OL,16,Ftoo.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
